{"title": "Reaper's Rigidity", "pageid": 27741, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Reaper's_Rigidity", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features", "Toggleable passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Reaper%27s_Rigidity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Reaper%27s_Rigidity.webp/300px-Reaper%27s_Rigidity.webp, /w/images/e/e6/Reaper%27s_Rigidity.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Reaper%27s_Rigidity.webp/300px-Reaper%27s_Rigidity.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Reaper%27s_Rigidity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Reaper's Rigidity</b> is a toggleable passive feature that controls whether or not you can be moved against your will by any spell or action.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When activated, you can't be moved against your will by any spell or action, but have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Dexterity <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reaper%27s_Embrace\" title=\"Reaper's Embrace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Reaper%27s_Embrace_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Reaper%27s_Embrace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Reaper%27s_Embrace_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Reaper%27s_Embrace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Reaper%27s_Embrace_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Reaper%27s_Embrace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Reaper%27s_Embrace_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Reaper%27s_Embrace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Reaper%27s_Embrace_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Reaper%27s_Embrace\" title=\"Reaper's Embrace\">Reaper's Embrace</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric Thorm</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">When activated, cannot be moved against its will, but has <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/DEX\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DEX\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">saving throws</a>.</div>\n</div> \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195523\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1232/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10922/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3442/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 145/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 873229/52428800 by